{
  "name": "ext-bindings",
  "description": "Scoped extension bindings (BND-11, docs/extensions/bindings.md): a fractal petal.map binding resolves per peer (resolved, not-installed with the Install offer, policy-denied after a device-local deny), a nearer petal binding overrides, demotion withdraws, Keep binding re-authors and a re-grant does not revive, and a kill-listed build stops where installed and is refused at install while the audited Owner override runs it on the Owner peer only.",
  "seed": 20261110,
  "fixture": "basic",
  "verse_name": "QA Basic",
  "assets": "generated",
  "peers": [
    {
      "name": "owner",
      "role": "owner"
    },
    {
      "name": "editor",
      "role": "editor"
    },
    {
      "name": "viewer",
      "role": "viewer",
      "extension_policy": {
        "deny": [
          "org.example.city-map"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "probe": {
    "rest_ms": 500,
    "hierarchy_ms": 2000,
    "ui_ms": 1000,
    "query_ms": 2000,
    "host_ms": 2000
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "0",
      "title": "Preflight: every peer in the shared verse",
      "settle_s": 15,
      "actions": [
        {
          "peer": "editor",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click",
          "args": {
            "name": "Close window",
            "role": "button"
          },
          "optional": true
        },
        {
          "peer": "editor",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click",
          "args": {
            "name": "Open verse QA Basic"
          },
          "optional": true
        },
        {
          "peer": "viewer",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click",
          "args": {
            "name": "Close window",
            "role": "button"
          },
          "optional": true
        },
        {
          "peer": "viewer",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click",
          "args": {
            "name": "Open verse QA Basic"
          },
          "optional": true
        }
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "probe": "role",
          "target": "$fixture.verse_id",
          "peers": [
            "editor"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "editor"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1",
      "title": "Owner and viewer install, consent and accept the city map; the editor becomes a Manager",
      "settle_s": 40,
      "covers": [
        "BND-11"
      ],
      "note": "The verse policy allows both builds (city-map, and city-map-legacy for step 6). The viewer installs while its policy still admits the package: its local extensions.toml deny (peers[].extension_policy) loads only at the restart in step 3. city-map provides petal.map without scene writes, so Viewer+ passes row 10 (assumed fixture manifest, bindings.md 8.1). Acceptance is the bind verb with verse_id (governance.md section Audit).",
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "pkg",
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "rest",
          "op": "request",
          "args": {
            "method": "GET",
            "path": "/api/v1/extensions/catalog/city-map"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "legacy_pkg",
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "rest",
          "op": "request",
          "args": {
            "method": "GET",
            "path": "/api/v1/extensions/catalog/city-map-legacy"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "policy",
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "rest",
          "op": "set_extension_policy",
          "args": {
            "verse_id": "$fixture.verse_id",
            "mode": "allow-list",
            "allow": [
              {
                "package_id": "org.example.city-map",
                "content_hash": "$pkg.content_hash"
              },
              {
                "package_id": "org.example.city-map-legacy",
                "content_hash": "$legacy_pkg.content_hash"
              }
            ]
          },
          "needs": [
            "pkg",
            "legacy_pkg"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "o_inst",
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "rest",
          "op": "install_extension",
          "args": {
            "package": "city-map",
            "verse_id": "$fixture.verse_id"
          },
          "bind": {
            "installation": "installation"
          },
          "needs": [
            "policy"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "o_consent",
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "rest",
          "op": "consent_extension",
          "args": {
            "installation": "$o_inst.installation",
            "grants": "manifest"
          },
          "needs": [
            "o_inst"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "o_accept",
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "rest",
          "op": "accept_extension",
          "args": {
            "installation": "$o_inst.installation"
          },
          "needs": [
            "o_consent"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "v_inst",
          "peer": "viewer",
          "via": "rest",
          "op": "install_extension",
          "args": {
            "package": "city-map",
            "verse_id": "$fixture.verse_id"
          },
          "bind": {
            "installation": "installation"
          },
          "needs": [
            "policy"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "v_consent",
          "peer": "viewer",
          "via": "rest",
          "op": "consent_extension",
          "args": {
            "installation": "$v_inst.installation",
            "grants": "manifest"
          },
          "needs": [
            "v_inst"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "v_accept",
          "peer": "viewer",
          "via": "rest",
          "op": "accept_extension",
          "args": {
            "installation": "$v_inst.installation"
          },
          "needs": [
            "v_consent"
          ]
        },
        {
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click_until",
          "args": {
            "click": {
              "name": "Browse all verses",
              "exact": true
            },
            "until": "Join a verse from browser",
            "max": 3
          }
        },
        {
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click",
          "args": {
            "name": "Options for verse QA Basic",
            "exact": true
          }
        },
        {
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click",
          "args": {
            "name": "Access",
            "role": "button",
            "exact": true
          }
        },
        {
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click",
          "args": {
            "name": "Role to assign for ${peers.editor.did}",
            "exact": true
          }
        },
        {
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click",
          "args": {
            "name": "manager",
            "exact": true
          }
        },
        {
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click",
          "args": {
            "name": "Assign role manager to ${peers.editor.did}",
            "exact": true
          },
          "id": "promote"
        },
        {
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click",
          "args": {
            "name": "Confirm Assign role manager to ${peers.editor.did}",
            "exact": true,
            "wait_s": 3
          },
          "optional": true
        }
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "probe": "extension",
          "target": "$o_inst.installation",
          "path": "state",
          "peers": [
            "owner"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "active",
          "within_s": 30,
          "after": "o_accept"
        },
        {
          "probe": "role",
          "target": "$fixture.verse_id",
          "peers": [
            "editor"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "manager",
          "within_s": 60,
          "after": "promote"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "title": "A fractal petal.map binding resolves where installed and offers Install where missing",
      "settle_s": 40,
      "covers": [
        "BND-11"
      ],
      "note": "Resolution is per peer and only the local DID sees it (bindings.md 5.5): every probe reads its own peer. The winning scope is the scope string (VERSE#v-FRACTAL#f), the local answer is points[].resolution.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "fractal_bind",
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "rest",
          "op": "set_binding",
          "args": {
            "verse_id": "$fixture.verse_id",
            "hook": "petal.map",
            "key": "",
            "fractal_id": "$fixture.fractal_id",
            "mode": "extension",
            "package_id": "org.example.city-map",
            "version_req": ">=1.2.0, <2.0.0",
            "config": {
              "district": "harbour"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "probe": "get",
          "target": "/api/v1/petals/${fixture.petal_a_id}/bindings/effective",
          "path": "points.0.package_id",
          "peers": [
            "owner",
            "editor",
            "viewer"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "org.example.city-map",
          "within_s": 30,
          "after": "fractal_bind",
          "covers": "the row replicates to every peer"
        },
        {
          "probe": "get",
          "target": "/api/v1/petals/${fixture.petal_a_id}/bindings/effective",
          "path": "points.0.scope",
          "peers": [
            "owner",
            "editor",
            "viewer"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "VERSE#${fixture.verse_id}-FRACTAL#${fixture.fractal_id}",
          "within_s": 30,
          "after": "fractal_bind"
        },
        {
          "probe": "get",
          "target": "/api/v1/petals/${fixture.petal_a_id}/bindings/effective",
          "path": "points.0.resolution.state",
          "peers": [
            "owner",
            "viewer"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "resolved",
          "within_s": 30,
          "after": "fractal_bind"
        },
        {
          "probe": "get",
          "target": "/api/v1/petals/${fixture.petal_a_id}/bindings/effective",
          "path": "points.0.resolution.reason",
          "peers": [
            "editor"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "not-installed",
          "within_s": 30,
          "after": "fractal_bind"
        },
        {
          "probe": "get",
          "target": "/api/v1/petals/${fixture.petal_a_id}/bindings/effective",
          "path": "points.0.resolution.offer",
          "peers": [
            "editor"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "install",
          "within_s": 30,
          "after": "fractal_bind",
          "covers": "the offer is for the local DID"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "title": "The editor takes the offer; the viewer's device policy turns its installed build policy-denied",
      "settle_s": 60,
      "covers": [
        "BND-11"
      ],
      "note": "Row 7 (policy-denied) needs an installed build: a peer that never installed stops at row 3 (bindings.md 5.2 order). The viewer's extensions.toml deny loads at this restart (governance reads it at startup only); the deny is local, so the owner and editor keep resolving.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "e_inst",
          "peer": "editor",
          "via": "rest",
          "op": "install_extension",
          "args": {
            "package": "city-map",
            "verse_id": "$fixture.verse_id"
          },
          "bind": {
            "installation": "installation"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "e_consent",
          "peer": "editor",
          "via": "rest",
          "op": "consent_extension",
          "args": {
            "installation": "$e_inst.installation",
            "grants": "manifest"
          },
          "needs": [
            "e_inst"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e_accept",
          "peer": "editor",
          "via": "rest",
          "op": "accept_extension",
          "args": {
            "installation": "$e_inst.installation"
          },
          "needs": [
            "e_consent"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "viewer_policy",
          "peer": "viewer",
          "via": "host",
          "op": "restart",
          "args": {},
          "needs": [
            "e_accept"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "probe": "get",
          "target": "/api/v1/petals/${fixture.petal_a_id}/bindings/effective",
          "path": "points.0.resolution.state",
          "peers": [
            "editor"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "resolved",
          "within_s": 40,
          "after": "e_accept"
        },
        {
          "probe": "get",
          "target": "/api/v1/petals/${fixture.petal_a_id}/bindings/effective",
          "path": "points.0.resolution.reason",
          "peers": [
            "viewer"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "policy-denied",
          "within_s": 90,
          "after": "viewer_policy"
        },
        {
          "probe": "get",
          "target": "/api/v1/petals/${fixture.petal_a_id}/bindings/effective",
          "path": "points.0.resolution.offer",
          "peers": [
            "viewer"
          ],
          "predicate": "absent",
          "within_s": 90,
          "after": "viewer_policy",
          "covers": "no dead control"
        },
        {
          "probe": "get",
          "target": "/api/v1/petals/${fixture.petal_a_id}/bindings/effective",
          "path": "points.0.resolution.state",
          "peers": [
            "owner",
            "editor"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "resolved",
          "mode": "always",
          "hold_s": 20,
          "after": "viewer_policy",
          "covers": "the device deny is local"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "title": "A nearer petal binding overrides the fractal one; clearing it returns to the fractal binding",
      "settle_s": 40,
      "covers": [
        "BND-11"
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "petal_builtin",
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "rest",
          "op": "set_binding",
          "args": {
            "verse_id": "$fixture.verse_id",
            "hook": "petal.map",
            "key": "",
            "fractal_id": "$fixture.fractal_id",
            "petal_id": "$fixture.petal_a_id",
            "mode": "builtin"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "petal_clear",
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "rest",
          "op": "set_binding",
          "args": {
            "verse_id": "$fixture.verse_id",
            "hook": "petal.map",
            "key": "",
            "fractal_id": "$fixture.fractal_id",
            "petal_id": "$fixture.petal_a_id",
            "clear": true
          },
          "needs": [
            "petal_builtin"
          ],
          "sync": "+15"
        }
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "probe": "get",
          "target": "/api/v1/petals/${fixture.petal_a_id}/bindings/effective",
          "path": "points.0.scope",
          "peers": [
            "owner",
            "editor",
            "viewer"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "VERSE#${fixture.verse_id}-FRACTAL#${fixture.fractal_id}-PETAL#${fixture.petal_a_id}",
          "within_s": 30,
          "after": "petal_builtin"
        },
        {
          "probe": "get",
          "target": "/api/v1/petals/${fixture.petal_a_id}/bindings/effective",
          "path": "points.0.resolution.state",
          "peers": [
            "owner",
            "editor",
            "viewer"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "builtin",
          "within_s": 30,
          "after": "petal_builtin",
          "covers": "nearest scope wins on every peer"
        },
        {
          "probe": "get",
          "target": "/api/v1/petals/${fixture.petal_b_id}/bindings/effective",
          "path": "points.0.scope",
          "peers": [
            "owner",
            "editor"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "VERSE#${fixture.verse_id}-FRACTAL#${fixture.fractal_id}",
          "within_s": 30,
          "after": "petal_builtin",
          "covers": "the sibling petal is untouched"
        },
        {
          "probe": "get",
          "target": "/api/v1/petals/${fixture.petal_a_id}/bindings/effective",
          "path": "points.0.resolution.state",
          "peers": [
            "owner",
            "editor"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "resolved",
          "within_s": 40,
          "after": "petal_clear"
        },
        {
          "probe": "get",
          "target": "/api/v1/petals/${fixture.petal_a_id}/bindings/effective",
          "path": "points.0.scope",
          "peers": [
            "owner",
            "editor"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "VERSE#${fixture.verse_id}-FRACTAL#${fixture.fractal_id}",
          "within_s": 40,
          "after": "petal_clear"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "5",
      "title": "Demoting a binding's author withdraws it; Keep binding re-authors it; a re-grant does not revive it",
      "settle_s": 60,
      "covers": [
        "BND-11"
      ],
      "note": "The editor (Manager) masks petal B with a petal-scope builtin. The owner revokes the grant (ext-fleet step 4 path): the version turns inadmissible on every peer (kept for audit) and the fractal binding applies again. Keep binding is the owner re-publishing the same row (bindings.md 4.5). The editor is then re-granted Editor so it can witness step 6; its withdrawn version stays inadmissible.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "editor_mask",
          "peer": "editor",
          "via": "rest",
          "op": "set_binding",
          "args": {
            "verse_id": "$fixture.verse_id",
            "hook": "petal.map",
            "key": "",
            "fractal_id": "$fixture.fractal_id",
            "petal_id": "$fixture.petal_b_id",
            "mode": "builtin"
          }
        },
        {
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click",
          "args": {
            "name": "Browse all verses",
            "exact": true
          },
          "needs": [
            "editor_mask"
          ],
          "sync": "+15"
        },
        {
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click",
          "args": {
            "name": "Options for verse QA Basic",
            "exact": true
          }
        },
        {
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click",
          "args": {
            "name": "Access",
            "exact": true
          }
        },
        {
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click",
          "args": {
            "name": "Revoke role grant for ${peers.editor.did}",
            "exact": true
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "demote",
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click",
          "args": {
            "name": "Confirm Revoke role grant for ${peers.editor.did}",
            "exact": true,
            "wait_s": 3
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "hold",
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "host",
          "op": "sleep",
          "args": {
            "seconds": 15
          },
          "needs": [
            "demote"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "keep",
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "rest",
          "op": "set_binding",
          "args": {
            "verse_id": "$fixture.verse_id",
            "hook": "petal.map",
            "key": "",
            "fractal_id": "$fixture.fractal_id",
            "petal_id": "$fixture.petal_b_id",
            "mode": "builtin"
          },
          "needs": [
            "hold"
          ]
        },
        {
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click",
          "args": {
            "name": "Role to assign for ${peers.editor.did}",
            "exact": true
          },
          "needs": [
            "keep"
          ]
        },
        {
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click",
          "args": {
            "name": "editor",
            "exact": true
          }
        },
        {
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click",
          "args": {
            "name": "Assign role editor to ${peers.editor.did}",
            "exact": true
          },
          "id": "regrant"
        },
        {
          "peer": "owner",
          "via": "gui",
          "op": "click",
          "args": {
            "name": "Confirm Assign role editor to ${peers.editor.did}",
            "exact": true,
            "wait_s": 3
          },
          "optional": true
        }
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "probe": "get",
          "target": "/api/v1/petals/${fixture.petal_b_id}/bindings/effective",
          "path": "points.0.mode",
          "peers": [
            "owner",
            "viewer"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "builtin",
          "within_s": 40,
          "after": "editor_mask"
        },
        {
          "probe": "get",
          "target": "/api/v1/petals/${fixture.petal_b_id}/bindings/effective",
          "path": "points.0.scope",
          "peers": [
            "owner",
            "viewer"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "VERSE#${fixture.verse_id}-FRACTAL#${fixture.fractal_id}",
          "within_s": 90,
          "after": "demote",
          "covers": "the withdrawn mask stops applying on every peer"
        },
        {
          "probe": "get",
          "target": "/api/v1/bindings?verse_id=${fixture.verse_id}&fractal_id=${fixture.fractal_id}&petal_id=${fixture.petal_b_id}",
          "path": "bindings",
          "peers": [
            "owner",
            "viewer"
          ],
          "predicate": "includes",
          "value": {
            "author_did": "${peers.owner.did}",
            "mode": "builtin",
            "effective": true
          },
          "within_s": 60,
          "after": "keep",
          "covers": "Keep binding re-authors as the clicking Manager"
        },
        {
          "probe": "get",
          "target": "/api/v1/petals/${fixture.petal_b_id}/bindings/effective",
          "path": "points.0.mode",
          "peers": [
            "owner",
            "viewer"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "builtin",
          "within_s": 60,
          "after": "keep"
        },
        {
          "probe": "role",
          "target": "$fixture.verse_id",
          "peers": [
            "editor"
          ],
          "predicate": "equals",
          "value": "editor",
          "within_s": 60,
          "after": "regrant"
        },
        {
          "probe": "get",
          "target": "/api/v1/bindings?verse_id=${fixture.verse_id}&fractal_id=${fixture.fractal_id}&petal_id=${fixture.petal_b_id}",
          "path": "bindings",
          "peers": [
            "owner",
